# Vercel builds the frontend only.
#
# The critical entry here is api/. Vercel treats a top-level `api/` directory
# as serverless functions by convention, so without this it tries to compile
# all twelve Express modules into lambdas — which is where the
# "TS2688: Cannot find type definition file for 'bun'" errors come from. They
# are not frontend build errors; they are Vercel failing to build an API that
# was never meant to run there.
#
# The Express API runs as its own container. Nothing in src/ imports from
# api/, so excluding it does not affect the bundle.
api

# Server- and container-only tooling.
docker
Dockerfile.api
Dockerfile.web
docker-compose.yml
dev.ts

.github
README.md
LICENSE
